*---------------------- HEADER FIELD
* Hand-written synthetic chart (CC0 / public domain) built from the BMS fiche of vsrg-format-docs.
* Timing edge cases: decimal #BPM, channel 08 with #BPMxx above 255 and with a decimal value, a negative #BPMxx
* (undefined by the spec; reverse scroll in some players), #STOPxx in 1/48 beat units, measure lengths 0.75 and 1.5 (channel 02).

#PLAYER 1
#GENRE Test
#TITLE Synthetic extended timing
#ARTIST vsrg-format-docs
#BPM 150.5
#BPM01 300
#BPM02 133.5
#BPM03 -90
#STOP01 48
#STOP02 96
#PLAYLEVEL 4
#RANK 2

#WAV01 bgm.ogg
#WAV02 tap.wav

*---------------------- MAIN DATA FIELD

#00001:01
* measure 0 (150.5 BPM): four taps on key 1
#00011:02020202

* measure 1: channel 08 switches to BPM 300 (#BPM01) at the start and to 133.5 (#BPM02) at mid-measure
#00108:0102
#00111:02000200

* measure 2: 3/4 measure; a one-beat stop (#STOP01 = 48) on slot 2 of 4
#00202:0.75
#00209:00000100
#00212:02020200

* measure 3: 6/4 measure; a two-beat stop (#STOP02 = 96) at its start, then the negative BPM (#BPM03 = -90) from slot 4 of 8
#00302:1.5
#00309:0200000000000000
#00308:0000000003000000
#00313:0200000002000000

* measure 4: the channel 03 integer BPM 120 (hex 78) overrides the negative value
#00403:78
#00414:02000200
